are</span></p></div><!--]--><!--[--><hr class="_tierRule_tytsc_286"><div class="_tierRateCell_tytsc_373"><!----><p class="_tierValueRow_tytsc_325"><span class="_tierValue_tytsc_325">$0.0010</span><span class="_tierUnit_tytsc_358">Per Share</span></p></div><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></div><!----><!----><div class="_footnotes_tytsc_491 _footnotesDisclaimer_tytsc_518 _footnotesDisclaimerProminent_tytsc_601"><!--[--><div class="_footnote_tytsc_491"><p class="_footnoteBody_tytsc_568">*If you hit a higher tier mid-month, you immediately receive the new rate and it carries forward into the next month.

If you miss the tier in a given month, you move to the previous applicable tier the following month.</p></div><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="_root_k5doy_32 _testimonialSection_5gcf6_47" style="--v3323c12e:0% 35%;--v04eb7e74:37% center;"><img width="1440" height="669" data-nuxt-img sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 1023px) 100vw, 1440px" srcset="/_ipx/f_webp&amp;s_1x669/img/marketing/equity/testimonial/desktop.png 1w, /_ipx/f_webp&amp;s_2x669/img/marketing/equity/testimonial/desktop.png 2w, /_ipx/f_webp&amp;s_768x357/img/marketing/equity/testimonial/desktop.png 768w, /_ipx/f_webp&amp;s_1440x669/img/marketing/equity/testimonial/desktop.png 1440w, /_ipx/f_webp&amp;s_1536x714/img/marketing/equity/testimonial/desktop.png 1536w, /_ipx/f_webp&amp;s_2880x1338/img/marketing/equity/testimonial/desktop.png 2880w" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt class="_bg_k5doy_65" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/_ipx/f_webp&amp;s_2880x1338/img/marketing/equity/testimonial/desktop.png"><div class="_bgTint_k5doy_80" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="_gradient_k5doy_87" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="_inner_k5doy_46"><h2 class="_title_k5doy_94 m-display"><!--[--><span class="_titleLine_k5doy_104">Our</span><span class="_titleLine_k5doy_104">Traders Say</span><!--]--></h2><div class="_cardSlot_k5doy_108"><article class="_card_k5doy_108"><div class="_quoteBlock_k5doy_146"><span class="_tick_k5doy_161" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="_quoteContent_k5doy_183"><header class="_bio_k5doy_196"><p class="_bioName_k5doy_204">EduTrades</p><p class="_bioRole_k5doy_220 m-body-b3">The Small-Cap Specialist</p></header><p class="_quote_k5doy_146">“Fast execution, reliable locates, direct routing, and everything you need to trade both the long and short side of fast-moving markets.”</p></div></div><div class="_divider_k5doy_241" aria-hidden="true"></div><dl class="_specs_k5doy_248"><!--[--><div class="_specRow_k5doy_256"><dt class="_specLabel_k5doy_263 m-body-b3">Style</dt><dd class="_specValue_k5doy_264 m-body-b3">Long &amp; Short Small-Cap Stocks</dd></div><div class="_specRow_k5doy_256"><dt class="_specLabel_k5doy_263 m-body-b3">Key Strategy</dt><dd class="_specValue_k5doy_264 m-body-b3">Capitalizing on momentum surges, failed breakouts, dilution patterns, and high-volatility reversals.</dd></div><div class="_specRow_k5doy_256"><dt class="_specLabel_k5doy_263 m-body-b3">Career Profits</dt><dd class="_specValue_k5doy_264 m-body-b3">$3 Million+</dd></div><div class="_specRow_k5doy_256"><dt class="_specLabel_k5doy_263 m-body-b3">Years of Trading</dt><dd class="_specValue_k5doy_264 m-body-b3">10+ Years</dd></div><!--]--></dl><p class="_disclosure_k5doy_279 m-footnote">This testimonial reflects the experience of one trader and may not be representative of other clients. Past performance is not indicative of future results. Trading involves substantial risk of loss.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="_root_1chox_31 _ctaBanner_5gcf6_54" style="--v67d07dc1:#fd7e29;--v020a4595:#FD5214;"><div class="_decor_1chox_40" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="_inner_1chox_64"><div class="_content_1chox_78"><div class="_heading_1chox_99"><h2 class="_title_1chox_112">Join The Home of
